<view class="container">
  <view class="section-title">学生认证</view>
  <view class="section-subtitle">支持学生证上传或校园邮箱认证，认证后会显示绿色标识。</view>

  <view class="card auth">
    <view class="auth-row">当前状态：<text class="badge">已认证大学生</text></view>
    <view class="auth-row">认证方式：校园邮箱</view>
    <view class="auth-row">信用分：95</view><view class="container">
  <view class="hero-card">
    <view class="title">学生认证</view>
    <view class="subtitle">
      完成认证后，你的主页会显示“已认证大学生”，并提升初始信用分。
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{verified}}" class="success-card">
    <view class="success-icon">✅</view>
    <view class="success-title">你已完成学生认证</view>
    <view class="success-text">认证信息已同步到云端数据库。</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:else class="form-card">
    <view class="field">
      <view class="label">真实姓名</view>
      <input
        class="input"
        placeholder="请输入真实姓名"
        value="{{realName}}"
        bindinput="onRealNameInput"
      />
    </view>

    <view class="field">
      <view class="label">学校</view>
      <input
        class="input"
        placeholder="请输入学校"
        value="{{school}}"
        bindinput="onSchoolInput"
      />
    </view>

    <view class="field">
      <view class="label">年级</view>
      <input
        class="input"
        placeholder="例如 2023级"
        value="{{grade}}"
        bindinput="onGradeInput"
      />
    </view>

    <view class="field">
      <view class="label">专业</view>
      <input
        class="input"
        placeholder="例如 软件工程"
        value="{{major}}"
        bindinput="onMajorInput"
      />
    </view>

    <view class="field">
      <view class="label">学号</view>
      <input
        class="input"
        placeholder="请输入学号"
        value="{{studentId}}"
        bindinput="onStudentIdInput"
      />
    </view>

    <button
      class="submit-btn"
      loading="{{loading}}"
      disabled="{{loading}}"
      bindtap="submitVerify"
    >
      提交认证
    </button>
  </view>
</view>

    <button class="btn-primary submit">提交认证</button>
  </view>
</view>
